{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1364149-thaumaturgy-for-talismans","id":1364149,"title":"Thaumaturgy for Talismans","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-30T06:52:05-08:00","id":1364149,"title":"Thaumaturgy for Talismans","content":"When I played first edition I was very taken with Talismans, they were a sort of barely magical trinket that provided a small bonus. They could be found by chance as the result of unusual occurrences, or they could be created by ambiguously defined &quot;magicians&quot; with a bit of resources, effort, and an Int + Occult roll.<br /> <br /> I see that these still exist, they're on page 580 of the core book. They are now created by &quot;gifted thaumaturgists&quot;. So I'm going to make appropriate thaumaturgy rituals for creating them,.<br /> <br /> The example rituals provided in the MA/ sorcery chapter are rather specific in their application, You can be an exorcist for ghosts, or demons, or spirits but they're separate rituals. On the othert hand an excercist for ghosts is for all ghosts and not just for hungry ghosts. From these examples I'm going to make rituals that can make a talisman of any resource value but for only one purpose.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Craft [Type] Talismans **</b><br /> A thaumaturgist who knows this ritual is able to craft one specific type of talisman, (talismans are discussed on p. 580 of the core book). The types of talisman include<br /> <br /> Protection from Disease<br /> Good Luck Charms<br /> Warding against Fair Folk<br /> \u200bWarding against\u200b Spirits<br /> Warding against Demons<br /> Warding against Elementals<br /> Warding against The Walking Dead<br /> <br /> but other types of talisman could be options, at the storyteller's discretion. Crafting a talisman takes a number of days equal to twice its resource cost and resurces equal to the talisman's resource cost -1, (meaning that resource * talismans can be made with no financial support). To complete the talisman successfully the thaumaturgist must roll intelligence + Occult with a difficulty equal to 1 + the resource cost of the talisman. If the thaumaturgist is able to incorporate a magically appropriate item into the talisman's construction both the difficulty of the roll and the resource cost might drop by one or two. Such item's might be a pebble which an attacker stumbled on that allowed their victim to escape, or the tooth of a particularly ferocious hobgoblin.<br /> <br /> These rituals are quite common (as far as thaumaturgy rituls can be common) and they are spread throughout all of creation. </div> </div> </div><br /> How does that look?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":872,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","user":"Apromor","date":". 01-30-2020, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T07:10:48-08:00","id":1364152,"title":"","content":"Sounds good but also sorta expensive exp-wise. Maybe have additional types you purchase after the 1st cost 1 dot instead of 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T14:18:37-08:00","id":1364225,"title":"","content":"Demons and Elementals are already spirits.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, what's the significance of their Resources cost? Where's it matter if I make a protective amulet against disease cost Resources 5 versus a Resources 1 one, other than of course the ability to sell it for fat stacks of cash?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T14:35:36-08:00","id":1364230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1364149-thaumaturgy-for-talismans?p=1364225#post1364225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demons and Elementals are already spirits.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, what's the significance of their Resources cost? Where's it matter if I make a protective amulet against disease cost Resources 5 versus a Resources 1 one, other than of course the ability to sell it for fat stacks of cash?</div> </div> </div> </div>Per the Core, a Talisman's protection can be invoked (Resource value) times <s>per day</s> per Scene. So Joe Farmer's good luck Charm might save them from a single swipe of a Hungry Dead, while a Dynast's priceless Talisman might protect them through an entire battle battle with an Elemental.<br /> <br /> Edit : corrected the limitation to per Scene as Alucard pointed out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25285,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","user":"Epitome","date":". 01-30-2020, 07:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T15:03:02-08:00","id":1364234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1364149-thaumaturgy-for-talismans?p=1364230#post1364230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Per the Core, a Talisman's protection can be invoked (Resource value) times per day.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually just reread it, it's per-<i>scene </i>for the ones that protect against say, elementals or Fair Folk, but there's no mention of how Resources factors into the usefulness of good luck or disease amulets.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T17:17:10-08:00","id":1364246,"title":"","content":"By default it doesn\u2019t so the ST would just set flat values for those kinds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T18:42:16-08:00","id":1364260,"title":"","content":"I got spirits from the description of talismans &quot; ...Fair Folk, <b>spirits</b>, elementals, demons or the walking dead ...&quot; (emphasis mine) But you're obviously correct, I suspect that they meant undead spirits and were just imprecise with their language. I'll change that when I rewrite it. I also like Epitome's idea of talisman rituals beyond the first getting learned as one dot rituals rather than two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}